Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 14:59:57 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 87/89] v1.0.1 #1: log symbolic+numeric VkResult at every
 submit/acquire/present/fence failure, memory budget + decoded driver at
 startup and on failure, optional VK_EXT_device_fault; fatal GPU failure shows
 one native 'WWE 13' dialog (GTK/Win32) and exits cleanly; debug-only
 WWE13_TEST_VULKAN_DEVICE_LOST_SUBMIT_N injector

